## Master Implementation Directive — Continuous Scientific Intelligence, Multi-Source Data Fusion, Knowledge Graph, Evidence-Based Learning and Predictive Earth Analytics

You are tasked with architecting and implementing the central intelligence engine of TERRANEXUS 4D.

This engine will become the intellectual core of the entire software platform.

It must connect all scientific modules, datasets, observations, analytical systems, historical records and AI capabilities into one coordinated intelligence architecture.

This is not a request to build another chatbot, a simulated AI dashboard, a demonstration with fabricated data, or a collection of hardcoded responses.

